WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.669
Let us balance the equation for hydrogen burning in oxygen to make water.

2
00:00:06.069 --> 00:00:22.080
First, count the atoms on each side. On the left there are two hydrogen atoms and two oxygen atoms. On the right there are two hydrogen atoms but only one oxygen atom. Oxygen is not balanced.

3
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:33.633
Put a two in front of water. Now the right side has two oxygen atoms, which matches. But it also has four hydrogen atoms.

4
00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:45.276
Put a two in front of hydrogen on the left. Now both sides have four hydrogen atoms and two oxygen atoms. The equation is balanced.

5
00:00:45.676 --> 00:01:02.078
Remember the rules. Only change the coefficients in front of formulas. Never change the small numbers inside a formula, because that would make a different substance. And always check every element at the end.
